# Large binaries live in Git LFS.
#
# trycord-desktop/release/Trycord.exe and TrycordPTB.exe are ~109 MB each.
# GitHub rejects any ordinary git blob over 100 MB outright, so tracking them
# as normal files is not an option - the push simply fails. LFS stores the
# content out of line and keeps only a pointer in the tree.
#
# The staging tree (win-unpacked, ~372 MB) stays a normal ignored build output.
trycord-desktop/release/*.exe filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
trycord-desktop/release/*.blockmap filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
